# Default build-context excludes (used by Dockerfile.team). node_modules are reinstalled in-image
# via npm ci; the rest is regenerated or not needed at agent runtime. The big one is deployer/vendor
# (3.6 GB gmx hardhat vendor). Dockerfile.base uses its own Dockerfile.base.dockerignore, which also
# strips team agent code from the base.
**/node_modules
.git
runs
cache
*.log
deployer/vendor
deployer/out
dashboard/dist
dashboard/build
